    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reframe.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a horrifying mystery in this non-linear RPG. Explore the city, complete quests, improve your stats, discover secrets, build relationships or just pet cats. Discover your purpose and meaning and make choices that will impact your life and the lives of the people you call friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/1c389df6fecd669cb7228d2f0c9edad3.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/1c389df6fecd669cb7228d2f0c9edad3.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/1c389df6fecd669cb7228d2f0c9edad3.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No &quot;Game Over&quot; screen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail in a battle, you'll have to deal with the consequences. Ranging from getting items/money/pants stolen to entire quests failing as a result! On the other hand, winning may give you special rewards that can unlock secret areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/2888d5f08a1fb3fd25ed3345bdaacf8c.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/2888d5f08a1fb3fd25ed3345bdaacf8c.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/2888d5f08a1fb3fd25ed3345bdaacf8c.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are not here to save the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny little nobody named Ilya, a first-year college student with no future, no past and no present. One fateful night, the world you thought you knew well, began to shatter. Now you'll have no choice but to press forward and find out what the hell is going on. Will you come out on top or will you succumb further into the sweet joy of comfort?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/afd7d8930928b7d9dae76c62fbd429b8.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/afd7d8930928b7d9dae76c62fbd429b8.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/afd7d8930928b7d9dae76c62fbd429b8.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day and night.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to classes in the morning, hit the gym in the afternoon, go to a party in the evening and fight incomprehensible horrors during the night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/38b6ac0560f1847324c098b3fa988b11.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/38b6ac0560f1847324c098b3fa988b11.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/38b6ac0560f1847324c098b3fa988b11.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is open.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do whatever you want whenever you want. Fight the bad guys, work at the shop, hit the gym, or attend classes like a total nerd.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Commit crimes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, seriously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additionally:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong> with 50+ unique characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> the bad guys! Gopniks, Hipsters, Alcoholics and even Robots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go</strong> to theater with your teacher. Awkward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve</strong> your strength by going to the gym!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve</strong> your perception by going biking, snowboarding, attending classes or shooting some bottles in the forest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy</strong> your health by drinking soda and eating chips! But it helps with <i>Energy</i> and <i>Sanity</i>, so maybe it's worth it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet</strong> a cat named Barsik! There are at least 3... No, wait, 4 cats in this game! Hold on, does this one even count?.. I'm not sure. You can only pet one, but it's just a demo, you know? I can promise that in the full release, you'll be able to pet at least 2 different cats!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Date</strong> weird girls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join</strong> W.I.M.P.!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made</strong> almost entirely by one person.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do <strong>none of the above</strong>! It's (sort of) open world! So do whatever you want whenever you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't worry. <strong>She</strong>\u00a0will always be watching you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reframe.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a horrifying mystery in this non-linear RPG. Explore the city, complete quests, improve your stats, discover secrets, build relationships or just pet cats. Discover your purpose and meaning and make choices that will impact your life and the lives of the people you call friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/1c389df6fecd669cb7228d2f0c9edad3.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/1c389df6fecd669cb7228d2f0c9edad3.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/1c389df6fecd669cb7228d2f0c9edad3.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No &quot;Game Over&quot; screen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fail in a battle, you'll have to deal with the consequences. Ranging from getting items/money/pants stolen to entire quests failing as a result! On the other hand, winning may give you special rewards that can unlock secret areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/2888d5f08a1fb3fd25ed3345bdaacf8c.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/2888d5f08a1fb3fd25ed3345bdaacf8c.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/2888d5f08a1fb3fd25ed3345bdaacf8c.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are not here to save the world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a tiny little nobody named Ilya, a first-year college student with no future, no past and no present. One fateful night, the world you thought you knew well, began to shatter. Now you'll have no choice but to press forward and find out what the hell is going on. Will you come out on top or will you succumb further into the sweet joy of comfort?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/afd7d8930928b7d9dae76c62fbd429b8.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/afd7d8930928b7d9dae76c62fbd429b8.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/afd7d8930928b7d9dae76c62fbd429b8.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Day and night.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to classes in the morning, hit the gym in the afternoon, go to a party in the evening and fight incomprehensible horrors during the night.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/38b6ac0560f1847324c098b3fa988b11.poster.avif?t=1755505860\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/38b6ac0560f1847324c098b3fa988b11.webm?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616980/extras/38b6ac0560f1847324c098b3fa988b11.mp4?t=1755505860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The world is open.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do whatever you want whenever you want. Fight the bad guys, work at the shop, hit the gym, or attend classes like a total nerd.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Commit crimes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, seriously.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additionally:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong> with 50+ unique characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> the bad guys! Gopniks, Hipsters, Alcoholics and even Robots!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go</strong> to theater with your teacher. Awkward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve</strong> your strength by going to the gym!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve</strong> your perception by going biking, snowboarding, attending classes or shooting some bottles in the forest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destroy</strong> your health by drinking soda and eating chips! But it helps with <i>Energy</i> and <i>Sanity</i>, so maybe it's worth it?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet</strong> a cat named Barsik! There are at least 3... No, wait, 4 cats in this game! Hold on, does this one even count?.. I'm not sure. You can only pet one, but it's just a demo, you know? I can promise that in the full release, you'll be able to pet at least 2 different cats!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Date</strong> weird girls! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join</strong> W.I.M.P.!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made</strong> almost entirely by one person.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do <strong>none of the above</strong>! It's (sort of) open world! So do whatever you want whenever you want.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't worry. <strong>She</strong>\u00a0will always be watching you.</p>",
